      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kua̱r Pi-lip jiök i̱, “Jiɛc rɔ, wër lot ni kui̱c cuëëc ɣɔaa kɛ dup in jiɛy kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm min luŋ rɔ kä Gadha.” (Mɛmɛ ɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p rɛy rɛ̈y dɔaar.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ rɔ jiɛc kä cuɛ wä. Kä täämɛ, tëëkɛ raan Bunyni mi jio̱w mi ci ben pal kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä ɛ kuäär yupä kuakni Kɛ̈n-dath, kuäär ciëk Bunyni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë tëë nyuurä rɛy thurbiɛɛlɛ mi yɔackɛ ɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k, kuɛɛnɛ bok go̱kä ni I-ca-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yiëë Pi-lip jiök i̱, “Wër mätni rɔ jɛ rɛy thurbiɛɛlɛ ɛmɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pi-lip riŋ kä jɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ liŋ kuɛnɛ bok go̱kä ni I-ca-yaa, kä cuɛ jɛ thiec i̱, “Cupɛ lɔɔcdu ɛnɔ kuɛɛni mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Dëë jɛ ŋa̱c i̱di, ɛ ni mi tëëkɛ ram mi nyuth jɛ ɣä?” Kä cuɛ Pi-lip cɔl kɛ ɣöö bɛ ben nyuur gekädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ gua̱a̱th in kuɛɛnɛ rɛy ruaacni Kuɔth in ca gɔ̱r ɛ nɛmɛ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
